h from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"integrations\">Integrations<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#integrations\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Every way to get a scene into Verse or a Verse scene onto a page, in one table: the platform, how the integration works, and how far it has been proven.</p>\n<p><strong>How to read the status column</strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>tested</strong></td><td>proven end to end by a gate in this repo against a real server (and, where it applies, a real browser)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>validated</strong></td><td>the code parses, type-checks and builds, and its schemas are checked, but it has not yet run on the live platform</td></tr><tr><td><strong>skeleton</strong></td><td>the shape is there; expect a first-run fix on the live platform</td></tr><tr><td><strong>listing pending</strong> / <strong>npm publish pending</strong></td><td>built and tested, and works today by hand (paste, upload, private install), but the public store listing or npm package is not published yet — see the per-row note</td></tr><tr><td><strong>in progress</strong></td><td>being built on a separate branch; not in this release</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"embed-on-a-page\">Embed on a page<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#embed-on-a-page\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Platform</th><th>Method</th><th>Status</th><th>Guide</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Any HTML page</td><td><code>&lt;verse-viewer&gt;</code> web component (<code>&lt;origin&gt;/sdk/verse-viewer.js</code>)</td><td>tested · npm publish pending (<code>@ctruhtech/verse-viewer</code>)</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-item\"><code>&lt;verse-viewer&gt;</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>React (Next.js, Remix, Gatsby)</td><td><code>@ctruhtech/verse-react</code> wrapper, SSR-safe</td><td>tested · npm publish pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue\">React and Vue</a></td></tr><tr><td>Vue 3 (Nuxt 3)</td><td><code>@ctruhtech/verse-vue</code> wrapper + plugin, SSR-safe</td><td>tested · npm publish pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-2\">React and Vue</a></td></tr><tr><td>Svelte, Angular, Lit, Astro, Qwik</td><td>the web component directly</td><td>tested (same element)</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-item-2\"><code>&lt;verse-viewer&gt;</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>Any HTML page</td><td>the plain iframe from Studio → Embed; oEmbed (<code>/oembed?url=</code>)</td><td>tested</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere\">Embed anywhere</a></td></tr><tr><td>WordPress</td><td>plugin (auto-embed, <code>[verse]</code> shortcode, block), uploadable zip</td><td>tested (plugin checks + server gate) · WordPress.org listing pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-2\">Embed anywhere</a></td></tr><tr><td>WooCommerce</td><td>the same plugin 1.1.0: product panel, 3D view tab, gallery replacement, <code>[verse_product]</code>, REST / Store API fields</td><td>validated · not yet run on a live store</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-3\">Sell with WooCommerce</a></td></tr><tr><td>Shopify</td><td>theme app extension (product-page block, per-product metafield)</td><td>validated · Shopify app listing pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-3\">Embed anywhere</a></td></tr><tr><td>Webflow</td><td>Code Embed recipe</td><td>tested (snippet)</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-4\">Embed anywhere</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wix</td><td>Embed HTML element; Velo page code + HtmlComponent</td><td>validated · snippet tested on a host page · not yet run on a live site</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-3\">Embed in Wix</a></td></tr><tr><td>Squarespace</td><td>Code block snippet</td><td>validated · snippet tested on a host page · not yet run on a live site</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-3\">Embed in Squarespace</a></td></tr><tr><td>BigCommerce</td><td>Page Builder widget template + Stencil partial</td><td>validated · snippet tested on a host page · widget registered per store by hand</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-3\">Sell with BigCommerce</a></td></tr><tr><td>Framer</td><td>code component with property controls</td><td>validated (<code>tsc</code>) · snippet tested on a host page · not yet run inside Framer</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-3\">Embed in Framer</a></td></tr><tr><td>Magento / Adobe Commerce</td><td>module (product attribute, block, template)</td><td>skeleton · needs a 2.4 test install</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento\">Sell with Magento</a></td></tr><tr><td>Ghost</td><td>paste the link (oEmbed discovery) or an HTML card</td><td>validated · snippet tested on a host page · discovery tags tested on the server</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-3\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a></td></tr><tr><td>HubSpot CMS</td><td>Embed module, or the custom HubL module (<code>hs upload</code>)</td><td>validated · snippet tested on a host page · not yet run on a live portal</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-4\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a></td></tr><tr><td>Elementor, any page builder</td><td>paste the HTML from Studio → Embed into the HTML block</td><td>tested (plain iframe)</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-5\">Embed anywhere</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Every embed is the same poster-first card underneath: nothing of the engine downloads until the card is in view (or tapped), and views count as <em>Arrived via: embed</em>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"automate\">Automate<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#automate\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Platform</th><th>Method</th><th>Status</th><th>Guide</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Zapier</td><td>Platform CLI app: triggers <code>scene.ready</code> / <code>scene.failed</code> / <code>comment.added</code>, actions upload-from-URL + share link, search analytics</td><td>validated (schema, <code>zapier validate</code>, app tester against a mock) · Zapier listing pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-3\">Automate with Zapier</a></td></tr><tr><td>Make (Integromat)</td><td>custom app: base, API-key connection, dedicated webhook, modules</td><td>validated (structure) · Make app listing pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-3\">Automate with Make</a></td></tr><tr><td>n8n</td><td>community node package <code>n8n-nodes-verse</code> (Verse + VerseTrigger with HMAC verification)</td><td>validated (<code>tsc</code>, build, manifest, signature self-test) · npm publish and n8n verification pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-3\">Automate with n8n</a></td></tr><tr><td>Any language</td><td>the REST API: token, upload or upload-from-URL, poll or webhook, share link, analytics</td><td>tested</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-3\">REST client round trip</a></td></tr><tr><td>JavaScript / TypeScript</td><td><code>@ctruhtech/verse-sdk</code></td><td>tested · npm publish pending</td><td><a href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-js-ts-sdk\">JS / TS SDK</a></td></tr><tr><td>GitHub Actions</td><td>the SDK&#39;s example workflow (<code>sdk/examples/</code>)</td><td>tested</td><td><a href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-js-ts-sdk-2\">JS / TS SDK</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"publish-from-a-tool\">Publish from a tool<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#publish-from-a-tool\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Method</th><th>Status</th><th>Guide</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Blender</td><td>add-on / extension (<code>verse_publish</code>)</td><td>shipped — verified in Blender 5.0.1</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-blender\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-blender-3\">Publish from Blender</a></td></tr><tr><td>Unity</td><td>package <code>com.ctruh.verse-publish</code></td><td>shipped — verified in Unity 6000.6.5f1 (Built-in, URP, HDRP)</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-unity\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-unity\">Publish from Unity</a></td></tr><tr><td>Unreal</td><td>plugin <code>VersePublish</code></td><td>shipped — verified in Unreal Engine 5.8.3</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-unreal\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-unreal\">Publish from Unreal</a></td></tr><tr><td>IFC / USD</td><td>upload the file as it is</td><td>tested</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-3\">Publish from IFC or USD</a></td></tr><tr><td>FBX / OBJ</td><td>upload the file (or a zip with its textures)</td><td>tested</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-3\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a></td></tr><tr><td>SketchUp, Rhino, 3ds Max, Revit, ArchiCAD</td><td>plug-in exports a GLB from inside the tool</td><td>beta (4.0.0-beta.1) — the upload core is tested against a real server; not yet run inside the host apps; each guide says what still needs a real install</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-sketchup\" id=\"lnk-sketchup\">SketchUp</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-rhino\" id=\"lnk-rhino\">Rhino</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-3dsmax\" id=\"lnk-3ds-max\">3ds Max</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-revit\" id=\"lnk-revit\">Revit</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-archicad\" id=\"lnk-archicad\">ArchiCAD</a></td></tr><tr><td>Maya, Cinema 4D, Houdini, SolidWorks, Figma, Spline</td><td>plug-in exports a GLB from inside the tool (SolidWorks and Figma: skeletons; Spline: export a GLB and upload it; Figma: inserts a Verse link)</td><td>beta (4.0.0-beta.1) — tested against fake hosts and a real server; not yet run inside the host apps</td><td><a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-maya\" id=\"lnk-maya\">Maya</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-cinema4d\" id=\"lnk-cinema-4d\">Cinema 4D</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-houdini\">Houdini</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-solidworks\">SolidWorks</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-spline-and-figma\">Spline and Figma</a></td></tr><tr><td>Phone / tablet LiDAR and capture apps, 3D tour export bundles, laser scanners</td><td>Import a scan (USDZ, GLB, OBJ zip, PLY, E57, XYZ / PTS, LAS / LAZ, a tour bundle&#39;s zip, splat PLY)</td><td>tested</td><td><a href=\"/docs/scan-import\" id=\"lnk-import-a-scan-3\">Import a scan</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"what-is-tested-where\">What is tested where<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-is-tested-where\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><code>web/test/fix-verify-integrations.mjs</code> — the web component, React and Vue in a real browser on a third-party origin; the REST round trip with a real webhook delivery; the upload-from-URL guard (units + live); every <code>integrations/embeds/*/snippet.html</code> on a host page; the embeds and automation check suites; this page and every guide above.</li><li><code>web/test/fix-verify-embeds.mjs</code> — oEmbed, link unfurls, laziness, the COEP host, the plug-in checks, the Studio panel.</li><li><code>node integrations/embeds/check.mjs</code> — PHP parses, JSON schemas, the Framer component type-checks, the plugin zip builds.</li><li><code>node integrations/automation/check.mjs</code> — the Zapier schema and app tester, Make&#39;s structure, the n8n build and signature check.</li></ul>\n<p>Store listings and npm packages are not published yet; until they are, every integration above installs by hand from this repository.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/integrations\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#embed-on-a-page\" id=\"lnk-embed-on-a-page\">Embed on a page</a><a href=\"#automate\" id=\"lnk-automate\">Automate</a><a href=\"#publish-from-a-tool\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-a-tool\">Publish from a tool</a><a href=\"#what-is-tested-where\" id=\"lnk-what-is-tested-where\">What is tested where</a></aside></section>"}